        </p>


        <a name="api-endpoints-creator"></a>
        <h5>GET Creator (Specific)</h5>

        <p>Get a specific creator record by id parameter.</p>

        <p>
            <a href="https://openaccess-api.clevelandart.org/api/creators/%7bid%7d">https://openaccess-api.clevelandart.org/api/creators/{id}</a>
        </p>

        <p><b>Parameters</b></p>

        <table class="table table-bordered">
            <tr>
                <td><b>Name</b></td>
                <td><b>Type</b></td>
                <td><b>Description</b></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><b>indent</b></td>
                <td>integer</td>
                <td>Number of spaces to indent JSON content if "pretty" formatting is desired.</td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <p><b>Example Request</b></p>

        <p>
            <a href="https://openaccess-api.clevelandart.org/api/creators/7978?indent=1">https://openaccess-api.clevelandart.org/api/creators/7978?indent=1</a>
        </p>

        <p><b>Example Response</b></p>

